 "remarks": "This beautifully maintained end-unit townhouse is ideally situated in one of the most convenient locations within the complex, offering the perfect balance of privacy and easy access. The main level features a bright, open floor plan with hardwood floors, a kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, a spacious dining area with sliders to a private balcony, and a comfortable living space that's perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Upstairs, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms with ample closet space, a full bath, and a conveniently located laundry area. The finished loft offers exceptional flexibility and can easily adapt to your needs as a home office, family room, guest retreat, or additional living space. A spacious two-car garage offers plenty of room for parking, storage, and everyday convenience. Conveniently located just minutes from downtown Stamford, Metro-North, shopping, restaurants, parks, and major highways, this move-in ready home offers the perfect combination of space, comfort, and location.",
